+# Changelog
+
+## 0.3.0
+
+- Exact finite quotients over number and rational-function fields, including native coefficient conversion, minimal polynomials, traces, norms, inversion and exceptional-fiber reconstruction.
+- Validated finite extension fields, Frobenius nilradicals and primary local factors, including products without linear separating elements.
+- Generated subfields, coefficient fields, constructive membership and Lüroth maps; reusable plane-curve genus and rationality arithmetic.
+- Function-decomposition orchestration belongs to alggeom. Real graph verification belongs to semialg.
+- Installed-wheel examples, generated specialist reference, explicit certificate-field audits and minimum/latest arithmetic CI profiles.
+- Corrected finite-extension characteristic polynomials and exact rational box conversion for singular endgames.
+
+## 0.2.0
+
+- Faster exact solving with guarded presolve, improved variable ordering and backend selection, and Gröbner order conversion only when needed.
+- Shared quotient algebra for RURs, multiplication matrices and border bases, with selective caching, lower-memory trace calculations and cost diagnostics.
+- Explicit completeness evidence, radical/nonreduced metadata and multiplicities, exact root certificates and adaptive certification boxes.
+- Bounded singular-root recovery through endgames, deflation and automatic projective chart switching, with clear certification limits.
+- More robust small and clustered roots, bounded Arb precision retries and consistent input checks.
+- Expanded tests, benchmarks, documentation; added 15 examples.
