+Exact arithmetic and solving for zero-dimensional algebraic systems in Python. Use `polysolve` for a finite polynomial system, `algsolve` when principal algebraic branches and poles matter, and `QuotientAlgebra` to work directly with its finite algebra and multiplicities. Exact field and curve arithmetic is available independently of numerical solving.
 
